/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# sqlx offline query cache state - the .sqlx/ dir itself is committed,
# but local DB files used during cargo sqlx prepare are not.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Editor noise
.DS_Store

# Tailwind v4 build output. `crates/web/assets/tailwind.css` is the
# source of truth (Tailwind + DaisyUI directives); the dx CLI runs
# the standalone tailwindcss binary against it (input/output paths
# from `[application] tailwind_*` in Dioxus.toml) to produce
# `tailwind.built.css`, which the asset!() macro in
# crates/web/src/app.rs references. `dx serve` watches and rebuilds
# on save; `dx build` compiles it once. The nix devenv shell creates
# an empty placeholder on first entry so plain `cargo check` /
# `cargo build` (no dx) can resolve the asset! path.
crates/web/assets/tailwind.built.css
